# Disabled deployment boundary
#
# This file is intentionally not a GitHub Actions workflow because its extension
# is `.disabled`. The imported production deployment was removed during the
# repository migration. Enabling Cloudflare, changing DNS, migrating data, or
# cutting over the running service requires a separate approved plan and PR.
#
# When an approved cutover PR rewrites this into `deploy.yml`, the workflow must
# be mechanical against Manut-owned resources only. Minimum shape (see
# docs/PRODUCTION_DEPLOY.md):
#
#   1. permissions: contents: read (+ id-token if OIDC); never pull_request_target
#   2. Node 24.18.0, pnpm 11.13.1, pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
#   3. pnpm --filter @manut/app export:web  →  apps/app/dist
#   4. pnpm --filter @manut/edge type-check && test
#   5. wrangler deploy --env production  (secrets from GitHub Environment only)
#   6. pnpm security:credentials apps/app/dist apps/edge/dist
#   7. Hyperdrive id already bound in apps/edge/wrangler.jsonc — do not invent
#
# Do not rename this file to .yml until those resources and reviewers exist.
